# Loot companion (m2b tasks 3.1-3.4, 5.2; SPEC 4.7). Needs Arpgtest online. The pet queues the character's kills and,
# out of combat, walks to each corpse and moves its gold and items into the bags (core store path: affixes, loot filter).

> .arpg test setup Arpgtest 20 elwynn-northshire
? ok .*\(online\)
> .arpg test clearbags Arpgtest
? ok
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.RecordEvents 1
? ok
> .arpg filter reset Arpgtest
? ok|filter
> .arpg lootpet on Arpgtest
? ok lootpet on
~ 2000
> .arpg lootpet info Arpgtest
? lootpet on pet=[1-9]\d* queue=0

# Three kills (Kobold Vermin: always carry gold, so no corpse is empty): the pet empties all three.
> .arpg test events Arpgtest clear
? ok
> .arpg test pack Arpgtest 6 3 kill loot
? killed=3
~ 12000
> .arpg lootpet info Arpgtest
? lootpet on pet=[1-9]\d* queue=0 looted=3
> .arpg test events Arpgtest
? lootpet looted corpse=6 items=\d+ gold=[1-9]\d*

# Off: the pet goes away.
> .arpg lootpet off Arpgtest
? ok lootpet off
~ 2000
> .arpg lootpet info Arpgtest
? lootpet off pet=0
> .arpg config set Arpg.Test.RecordEvents 0
? ok
